\cb3     <h2>Why We Formed</h2>\cb1 \
\cb3     <p>The Hopkins County Young Republicans was founded to give young conservatives in our community a place to connect, grow, and take action. We exist to promote conservative principles among people under 40 in Hopkins County, build real relationships, and strengthen local Republican engagement.</p>\cb1 \
\cb3     <p>As a chapter of the Young Republicans of Texas (the official youth wing of the Republican Party of Texas), we focus on America First values, local activism, and preparing the next generation of leaders.</p>\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3     <h2>Who It\'92s For</h2>\cb1 \
\cb3     <p>Conservatives ages 18\'9640 who live in or care about Hopkins County. Older adults are welcome at public events. Whether you\'92re new to politics or already involved, this is a place to meet like-minded people, learn, and get to work in our community.</p>\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
