\cb3       </div>\cb1 \
\cb3       <div>\cb1 \
\cb3         <h3>Activism</h3>\cb1 \
\cb3         <p>All politics is local. We get involved in campaigns, block walks, and protecting our community and institutions.</p>\cb1 \
